      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 — Telegram Receipt Photo Processing (Gemini)\nSETUP: 1) Create Telegram bot via BotFather, connect Telegram credentials. 2) Connect Sheets + Drive OAuth. 3) Edit Config (Sheet ID, Drive PDS_Receipts root folder ID). 4) Create a Header Auth credential in n8n: Name = x-goog-api-key, Value = your Gemini API key (free from Google AI Studio); select it on the Gemini Vision Extract node. Works on n8n Cloud AND self-hosted — no env vars, and the key never appears in this JSON. 5) Create Sheet tabs Receipts / Errors (see docs/SHEETS_SCHEMA.md). 6) Activate.\nFLOW: photo -> meta (largest size, 15MB cap) -> dedupe by file_unique_id -> ensure Drive folder Receipts/<YYYY-MM-DD> -> download -> upload ORIGINAL bytes (renamed <date>_<msgid>.<ext> to avoid collisions; original extension kept) -> Gemini (temp 0.1, JSON mode, key via Header Auth credential) -> strict parse+validate (amount/date/confidence normalized, low-confidence flagged needs_review, never throws) -> UPSERT row by file_unique_id (replay-safe) -> Telegram confirmation (or review request / duplicate / usage replies).\nNO SECRETS in this file. Timezone Asia/Manila.",
